OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with rain soon
OL,6,Fmoving northeastwards to all areas.
OL,7,FOccasionally heavy rain from late
OL,8,Fmorning will ease during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, allowing some late
OL,10,Fbrightness. Winds strengthening again,
OL,11,Fwith strong and gusty winds by late
OL,12,Fafternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening, with
OL,15,Fclear spells. Further occasionally
OL,16,Fheavy rain passes through in the early
OL,17,Fhours, clearing around dawn, followed
OL,18,Fby clearer spells. Strong and gusty
OL,19,Fwinds throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
