OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA brighter day with some
OL,6,Fsunny spells, these mixed with
OL,7,Fisolated blustery showers, some of
OL,8,Fwhich could be heavy. Winds easing a
OL,9,Flittle later in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells Wednesday, with occasional
OL,13,Fshowers. Winds falling light. Fog
OL,14,Fpatches Thursday and Friday mornings,
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells later. Temperatures
OL,16,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
